WEBVTT

00:07.382 --> 00:08.508
Didn't I tell you?

00:08.591 --> 00:11.010
Viena and Fiena are two as one.

00:11.094 --> 00:13.304
Yes, we are two as one.

00:13.388 --> 00:15.974
What a troublesome fellow.

00:16.057 --> 00:20.186
I guess as long as both their god cores
aren't destroyed simultaneously,

00:20.270 --> 00:21.855
they can regenerate infinitely.

00:22.355 --> 00:23.732
Destroy simultaneously?

00:23.815 --> 00:26.025
Who could pull off a feat like that?

00:26.109 --> 00:27.652
But this is the only way.

00:27.736 --> 00:31.031
We need to consume more
and gain more skills.

00:31.114 --> 00:32.449
If we can get to the surface,

00:32.532 --> 00:34.534
we should be able to find a lot of fodder.

00:35.869 --> 00:38.997
But I'm going to eat
this handsome guy first.

00:39.080 --> 00:41.249
With my next move,
I'll definitely devour you.

00:43.042 --> 00:44.586
Viena's target is me.

00:45.170 --> 00:46.755
I'll leave Fiena to you, Ms. Alina.

00:46.838 --> 00:49.215
Can you handle her
with your Sigurth skills?

00:49.299 --> 00:51.676
Don't worry. I have a plan.

00:51.760 --> 00:53.470
I see. That's good.

00:54.554 --> 00:55.680
Let's go!

01:01.978 --> 01:04.022
<i>With my Sigurth skills,</i>

01:04.105 --> 01:06.816
<i>there's no way I can stand up
to a dark god's Dia skills.</i>

01:06.900 --> 01:10.236
I wonder how your soul tastes.

01:15.992 --> 01:18.703
Then I have no choice,
but to bet on this move!

01:20.413 --> 01:21.706
Skill Activate!

01:21.790 --> 01:22.874
Sigurth Wall!

01:22.957 --> 01:23.792
GUARDIAN OF THE IRON WALL

01:24.375 --> 01:27.337
- Is he using it on the ground?
- What is he doing?

01:27.420 --> 01:29.214
Skill Activate!

01:29.297 --> 01:30.965
Sigurth Wall!

01:31.591 --> 01:34.010
<i>I once tried activating
my skills repeatedly,</i>

01:34.093 --> 01:35.970
<i>but I realized the effect doesn't stack.</i>

01:42.644 --> 01:45.230
<i>However, as long as I stack another skill</i>

01:45.313 --> 01:47.273
<i>on top of the one activated beforehand...</i>

01:48.399 --> 01:49.567
Skill Activate.

01:49.651 --> 01:51.528
Sigurth Blood!

01:51.611 --> 01:54.114
Hey. What are you even doing?

01:54.197 --> 01:55.490
That's totally pointless.

01:56.074 --> 01:58.618
Converge. Deploy!

02:00.203 --> 02:01.996
Composite Skill Activate!

02:02.080 --> 02:03.498
Millia!

02:12.173 --> 02:14.634
Stop struggling in vain.

02:19.139 --> 02:20.306
What?

02:22.392 --> 02:24.853
He blocked a Dia skill?

02:24.936 --> 02:26.020
That was next level!

02:30.233 --> 02:31.276
Millia!

02:54.883 --> 02:56.718
No way...

03:08.354 --> 03:09.898
Hey, are you okay?

03:10.648 --> 03:11.816
I'm fine.

03:11.900 --> 03:14.736
When did you learn that kind of skill?

03:16.154 --> 03:18.239
I guess you could say
it's the fruit of my efforts.

03:19.908 --> 03:21.868
Too bad.

03:26.289 --> 03:27.832
I was really surprised just now.

03:27.916 --> 03:29.584
As expected of a handsome guy,
he's built differently.

03:29.667 --> 03:31.419
They've regenerated!

03:31.502 --> 03:33.588
Did we fail to hit it at the same time?

03:33.671 --> 03:36.174
But this sure is humiliating.

03:36.257 --> 03:39.636
Hurry up and be my fodder,
so I can gain more skills!

03:45.141 --> 03:46.434
Get out of the way!

03:54.192 --> 03:55.109
Stand up!

03:55.193 --> 03:57.570
If you get eaten,
things will get more complicated.

03:59.030 --> 04:01.658
The fodder is running away!

04:03.326 --> 04:04.494
Fiena!

04:05.078 --> 04:07.288
- Do I have to do it?
- We have to do it.

04:11.125 --> 04:12.961
Good girl.

04:22.303 --> 04:26.057
You guys are really pissing me off. Die!

04:26.140 --> 04:29.978
Die! Die! Die!

04:36.442 --> 04:37.610
What's wrong with her?

04:37.694 --> 04:39.737
There are two Dia marks?

04:40.363 --> 04:43.074
I am Vilfina.

04:47.870 --> 04:48.705
Die!

05:07.932 --> 05:09.559
Ms. Alina!

05:09.642 --> 05:10.893
Ms. Alina!

05:11.561 --> 05:12.478
Are you okay?

05:25.658 --> 05:27.618
This is no ordinary wound.

05:27.702 --> 05:28.619
Heal!

05:28.703 --> 05:29.579
HEALING LIGHT

05:33.833 --> 05:35.877
Even magic doesn't work.

05:35.960 --> 05:38.671
Remove Sigurth Revive from me.

05:39.255 --> 05:40.965
And use it on Ms. Alina.

05:42.383 --> 05:43.342
I'm counting on you.

05:44.052 --> 05:44.969
Okay.

05:46.304 --> 05:47.430
Skill Activate.

05:47.513 --> 05:49.140
Sigurth Revive!

05:56.355 --> 05:58.483
It's no use.

05:58.566 --> 06:03.571
Well, this
is a skill that directly grants you death.

06:03.654 --> 06:06.616
Even if you get a slight scratch,
you'll die for sure.

06:06.699 --> 06:07.867
What?

06:07.950 --> 06:10.078
It's lame, so I didn't want to use it.

06:10.745 --> 06:12.789
But if she dies,
I'll be able to use more skills.

06:12.872 --> 06:14.040
It's not a bad idea, right?

06:14.123 --> 06:15.249
Shut up!

06:16.375 --> 06:17.960
I won't let Ms. Alina die.

06:19.087 --> 06:20.171
Absolutely not!

06:20.254 --> 06:23.216
What? You're so annoying.

06:23.299 --> 06:25.176
I'll buy you some time.

06:25.259 --> 06:26.719
Take care of Ms. Alina.

06:28.846 --> 06:29.722
Okay.

06:29.806 --> 06:32.183
What can you do alone?

06:32.266 --> 06:33.935
Hurry up and die!

06:37.396 --> 06:38.314
Converge.

06:39.774 --> 06:41.317
Deploy!

06:44.445 --> 06:47.115
Composite Skill Act...

06:54.080 --> 06:55.790
What?

06:55.873 --> 06:57.458
What's wrong, cutie?

06:58.584 --> 07:01.462
<i>Damn it. My power...</i>

07:01.546 --> 07:04.090
You can't do anything.

07:04.173 --> 07:05.925
Nor can you protect anyone.

07:06.008 --> 07:09.178
So just sit there and watch obediently

07:09.804 --> 07:12.348
as I devour that child's soul.

07:18.187 --> 07:19.272
<i>Stop.</i>

07:19.814 --> 07:22.859
<i>I can't let her succeed.
I have to aggro her!</i>

07:22.942 --> 07:24.277
<i>Think of something.</i>

07:24.360 --> 07:27.363
<i>How can I get her attention?</i>

07:35.663 --> 07:37.165
Failed creation.

07:39.083 --> 07:41.169
What did you just say?

07:41.919 --> 07:43.588
Didn't you hear me?

07:44.213 --> 07:46.591
I said you're a failed creation.

07:50.720 --> 07:55.766
I hate foolish provocations
like this the most.

07:56.434 --> 08:00.438
You both had half
of the Dia mark on your faces.

08:00.521 --> 08:02.148
But after merging and becoming Vilfina,

08:02.231 --> 08:05.943
why didn't it turn
into a complete Dia mark?

08:06.986 --> 08:09.071
Viena, don't listen to him.

08:10.323 --> 08:12.867
You two can regenerate,
but your bodies are weak.

08:13.868 --> 08:17.371
Once merged, your combat power improves,
but your intellect vanishes.

08:18.164 --> 08:20.666
Isn't that too sloppy for a dark god?

08:21.250 --> 08:22.168
No.

08:22.835 --> 08:25.546
You're not two as one,

08:26.339 --> 08:29.300
but merely failed prototypes
before the finished product is created.

08:29.383 --> 08:31.844
- Nonsense!
- Viena!

08:32.553 --> 08:34.931
That's why the ancients carved
half a mark on you

08:35.598 --> 08:37.934
as proof that you're a failed creation!

08:38.017 --> 08:42.021
Shut up! No! No...

08:42.855 --> 08:44.190
How dare you say we're failed creations?

08:44.941 --> 08:47.276
How dare a mere fodder be this brazen?

08:47.360 --> 08:49.445
I'm going to devour you first!

08:49.529 --> 08:50.780
I'm going to tear you apart

08:50.863 --> 08:53.658
and make you understand
what real suffering is!

08:54.242 --> 08:58.454
I'm not going to die that easily.

08:58.538 --> 08:59.789
Converge.

09:00.289 --> 09:01.624
Deploy!

09:05.461 --> 09:07.880
Composite Skill Activate.

09:09.465 --> 09:10.758
Millia!

09:13.970 --> 09:16.973
Heal didn't work.
Minoos didn't work either.

09:17.056 --> 09:20.518
And Sigurth Revive has no effect at all.

09:26.315 --> 09:28.985
Again, because of me...

09:30.236 --> 09:31.237
I'm sorry.

09:31.862 --> 09:33.781
But I really can't do it.

09:35.074 --> 09:37.743
I can't do anything.

09:40.204 --> 09:44.792
I'm sorry...

09:44.875 --> 09:47.086
Then it's okay.

09:49.255 --> 09:51.924
You shouldn't move around. Your wound...

09:52.008 --> 09:53.175
It doesn't matter.

09:53.259 --> 09:54.802
If I can't beat them, I'll die anyway.

09:56.512 --> 09:59.390
When you come up with a good idea,

09:59.473 --> 10:01.058
let me know.

10:01.726 --> 10:03.060
I already...

10:06.230 --> 10:10.818
I don't want to lose
anyone connected to me.

10:11.569 --> 10:14.572
<i>Even someone like that,
I don't want to lose either.</i>

10:14.655 --> 10:16.324
<i>For that, I'm willing
to fight to the death.</i>

10:17.491 --> 10:18.659
No matter how much it hurts

10:18.743 --> 10:20.911
or how unbearable it gets,
it doesn't matter.

10:23.372 --> 10:26.751
Skill Activate. Dia Break.

10:27.918 --> 10:31.756
I'm only fighting for myself!

10:35.301 --> 10:37.762
<i>What am I doing?</i>

10:37.845 --> 10:39.805
<i>Despite my past mistakes,</i>

10:39.889 --> 10:42.391
<i>I shamelessly continue to be a healer.</i>

10:42.475 --> 10:44.268
<i>Isn't it because I'm frustrated?</i>

10:44.352 --> 10:47.104
<i>Isn't it because I don't want
to be called a murderer forever</i>

10:47.855 --> 10:50.941
<i>and want to grow stronger?</i>

10:51.984 --> 10:53.527
Ms. Alina!

10:53.611 --> 10:56.530
I'll try to heal that wound.

10:58.074 --> 10:59.283
All right.

11:01.786 --> 11:03.162
<i>I don't know if I can do it.</i>

11:03.245 --> 11:06.499
<i>But Jade showed me that it's possible.</i>

11:06.582 --> 11:08.042
<i>That's why I'm also going to...</i>

11:08.751 --> 11:11.545
Skill Activate. Sigurth Revive!

11:16.050 --> 11:18.594
Skill Activate. Sigurth Revive!

11:24.058 --> 11:24.934
<i>At this rate...</i>

11:31.065 --> 11:32.400
<i>No.</i>

11:32.483 --> 11:35.403
<i>Skill Activate. Sigurth Revive!</i>

11:55.464 --> 11:56.298
Don't worry.

11:56.382 --> 12:00.344
You just need to do
what feels natural to you.

12:00.428 --> 12:01.887
That'll be enough.

12:01.971 --> 12:03.180
That's right.

12:03.264 --> 12:05.891
Be confident in your job.

12:06.934 --> 12:09.061
<i>Everyone believes in me so much.</i>

12:09.937 --> 12:12.356
<i>This time, I want to save everyone.</i>

12:12.440 --> 12:15.151
<i>So I have to believe in myself too.</i>

12:15.901 --> 12:18.612
<i>Because this is my job.</i>

12:19.405 --> 12:23.284
Skill Activate. Sigurth Revive!

12:32.042 --> 12:33.586
Get lost now.

12:34.587 --> 12:37.006
You'll get in the way if you stay.

12:37.089 --> 12:38.215
Damn it.

12:38.299 --> 12:41.469
It's all her fault.
It's all that murderer's fault.

12:42.178 --> 12:44.847
You have no right to speak ill of Lululee.

12:44.930 --> 12:46.223
What?

12:46.849 --> 12:49.268
Lululee isn't like you.

12:49.351 --> 12:51.353
She didn't run away
from her powerlessness,

12:51.437 --> 12:53.772
nor did she run away
from her duty as a healer.

12:57.359 --> 12:58.444
Listen up!

12:58.527 --> 13:02.448
Don't ever show your filthy face
in front of Lululee again!

13:17.922 --> 13:19.798
I... I did it!

13:19.882 --> 13:22.009
Ms. Alina, I cured you!

13:26.722 --> 13:27.890
Ms. Alina?

13:28.766 --> 13:32.645
No. Don't die! Ms. Alina!

13:32.728 --> 13:34.772
Ms. Alina!

13:37.733 --> 13:39.735
<i>Ms. Alina.</i>

13:48.494 --> 13:53.249
<i>What am I doing now?</i>

13:54.416 --> 13:55.501
It's no good.

13:56.460 --> 14:00.422
<i>I can't think of anything.</i>

14:09.056 --> 14:11.058
<i>The so-called Souls Rest Ceremony</i>

14:12.560 --> 14:16.355
<i>is a ritual to mourn the souls
of those fallen adventurers.</i>

14:22.069 --> 14:25.948
<i>Some say it's to comfort the souls
of those left behind.</i>

14:30.786 --> 14:34.164
<i>I no longer want
to live that kind of lonely life anymore.</i>

14:45.175 --> 14:46.302
<i>I have to go.</i>

14:52.016 --> 14:53.225
Jade!

14:54.935 --> 14:56.228
Ms. Alina.

14:57.438 --> 14:59.857
Why do you always end up
on the verge of death?

15:00.691 --> 15:05.070
I see. Did Lululee succeed?

15:05.154 --> 15:06.780
That's great.

15:09.450 --> 15:12.453
Well done. Leave the rest to me.

15:12.536 --> 15:14.747
Hey, what's going on?

15:14.830 --> 15:16.999
We should've hit her.

15:17.082 --> 15:19.335
But why are you still alive?

15:19.418 --> 15:22.838
Even if you attack me a hundred times,
you can't kill me!

15:22.922 --> 15:27.217
You're just mere fodder.
Don't be so arrogant!

15:27.301 --> 15:29.094
I'll show you what I'm capable of!

15:35.851 --> 15:38.854
You're destined to die by my hand
and be completely devoured by us!

15:39.939 --> 15:41.607
Die! Die!

15:44.985 --> 15:46.904
I am Vilfina.

15:47.821 --> 15:49.114
Just so you know,

15:49.198 --> 15:51.408
I'm absolutely furious right now.

15:52.034 --> 15:53.994
I was so looking forward to it.

15:54.078 --> 15:55.371
I worked overtime every day.

15:56.163 --> 16:02.378
Do you know why I left
the Centennial Festival to come here?

16:02.461 --> 16:05.756
If anyone tries to take away
what's important to me,

16:05.839 --> 16:08.258
be it a dark god or God,

16:08.342 --> 16:10.260
I will never forgive them!

16:10.344 --> 16:11.804
Skill Activate!

16:13.681 --> 16:15.307
Dia Break!

16:20.688 --> 16:22.064
Die!

16:24.525 --> 16:28.737
Die!

16:30.280 --> 16:31.240
Enough already!

16:32.282 --> 16:33.784
Just

16:34.994 --> 16:36.745
die!

16:58.642 --> 17:00.477
Lululee, are you all right?

17:03.605 --> 17:05.274
You're finally awake.

17:06.275 --> 17:09.236
Ms. Alina. You're alive?

17:09.319 --> 17:11.113
Yes, I'm alive and kicking.

17:11.905 --> 17:13.449
I see.

17:14.033 --> 17:15.242
I'm glad.

17:15.909 --> 17:17.703
I'm so glad.

17:18.412 --> 17:20.914
I knew you could do it.

17:21.540 --> 17:24.084
Thank you for saving me.

17:24.168 --> 17:25.502
Don't say that.

17:26.211 --> 17:29.965
If it were just me,
I would have given up a long time ago.

17:31.258 --> 17:35.888
The truth is,
I've always hated Sigurth Revive.

17:35.971 --> 17:39.224
I always wondered
why this skill manifested in me.

17:39.308 --> 17:43.353
However, thanks to this skill,
I was able to protect those dear to me.

17:44.188 --> 17:45.189
I can finally...

17:45.272 --> 17:47.983
I can finally love this power.

17:48.734 --> 17:51.361
So from now on, I want to keep

17:51.445 --> 17:54.490
working hard with all of you forever.

17:56.533 --> 17:58.452
The same goes for us.
We're counting on you.

17:59.578 --> 18:00.913
No problem!

18:08.420 --> 18:10.130
It's really happening again.

18:10.756 --> 18:12.257
It's quite lively.

18:12.341 --> 18:14.718
Why are you here?

18:15.511 --> 18:17.221
We promised to go on a date for a day.

18:17.846 --> 18:19.306
We still have half a day left, right?

18:19.389 --> 18:21.725
What? That's already...

18:22.768 --> 18:23.727
Whatever.

18:24.394 --> 18:25.437
Stay with me for a while.

18:32.611 --> 18:34.863
- Jade.
- This is...

18:35.823 --> 18:37.908
I hope you can light it for me.

18:37.991 --> 18:39.201
Are you sure you want me to?

18:44.915 --> 18:48.627
When I was a kid,
an adventurer I knew died.

18:50.170 --> 18:51.421
That adventurer

18:52.047 --> 18:53.757
was called Shroud.

18:54.508 --> 18:55.926
We were pretty close back then.

18:56.760 --> 18:57.845
Shroud?

18:58.887 --> 18:59.888
I see.

19:04.226 --> 19:05.227
Jade.

19:07.062 --> 19:08.313
Don't die, okay?

19:11.066 --> 19:12.985
Wait, it's nothing!

19:13.068 --> 19:16.113
You're so tenacious, I don't think
they can kill you even if they try!

19:16.196 --> 19:18.115
What I just said doesn't count.
That doesn't count.

19:18.198 --> 19:20.492
Please forget about it. It doesn't count.

19:20.576 --> 19:22.369
- Other than by Ms. Alina's warhammer,
- It doesn't count.

19:22.452 --> 19:24.079
I don't plan on dying
at anyone else's hands.

19:24.163 --> 19:26.039
I said that doesn't count.

19:26.123 --> 19:28.000
Hey, Alina.

19:28.083 --> 19:30.377
Are you on a date
with Silver Sword's boss?

19:30.961 --> 19:31.920
No, I'm not.

19:32.004 --> 19:35.632
He forced me to go on a date with him
in exchange for something irresistible.

19:35.716 --> 19:39.011
Wait a minute. If you say that,
I'll lose my place in society.

19:39.094 --> 19:40.262
Oh, that's right.

19:40.345 --> 19:41.763
Thank you for everything you've done.

19:43.223 --> 19:44.933
The other day,
even though the time was up,

19:45.017 --> 19:46.643
you still helped me take on a quest.

19:46.727 --> 19:49.855
We don't have to wait long at Alina's
counter, no matter how crowded it is.

19:49.938 --> 19:51.273
That really helps a lot.

19:51.356 --> 19:52.983
To Alina's job!

19:53.066 --> 19:54.735
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

19:57.321 --> 20:00.490
<i>I can't believe
everyone would see me that way.</i>

20:01.408 --> 20:02.910
<i>I feel like my chest
is overflowing with warmth.</i>

20:03.577 --> 20:05.996
<i>It's burning...</i>

20:06.997 --> 20:08.582
<i>Feels like I'm about to burn out!</i>

20:10.167 --> 20:12.419
In other words,
this is what you mean, right?

20:12.502 --> 20:16.506
You guys line up at my counter on purpose

20:16.590 --> 20:19.843
and deliberately make me work overtime?

20:20.802 --> 20:22.346
All of you listen carefully!

20:22.429 --> 20:24.848
If you see that my counter
is crowded next time,

20:24.932 --> 20:27.309
line up at another counter immediately!

20:27.392 --> 20:32.272
Don't increase my overtime!

20:48.538 --> 20:49.539
What?

20:50.249 --> 20:51.959
Why is it so noisy?

20:52.042 --> 20:55.504
Shouldn't we pray more quietly?

20:56.255 --> 20:58.799
There are no tears
in the Souls Rest Ceremony.

20:59.508 --> 21:02.594
It's so that the souls ascending
to the sky won't feel lonely.

21:03.595 --> 21:05.055
It's also so that the souls left behind

21:05.639 --> 21:08.433
won't be bound by sadness forever.

21:16.441 --> 21:18.151
There you are.

21:18.235 --> 21:20.362
We've been looking for you guys.

21:21.363 --> 21:22.864
Did you go shopping?

21:22.948 --> 21:26.702
Well then,
to celebrate the whole team's safe return,

21:26.785 --> 21:27.828
let's have an after-party!

21:28.704 --> 21:30.789
I can't. I have work tomorrow.

21:30.872 --> 21:34.793
No way. Come with us, Ms. Alina.

21:37.713 --> 21:39.589
Well, I guess I have no choice.

21:39.673 --> 21:42.551
In that case, let's drink
to our hearts' content tonight!

21:42.634 --> 21:44.469
All right!

21:44.553 --> 21:46.263
Now that's more like it!

21:49.808 --> 21:50.892
<i>How should I put it?</i>

21:51.476 --> 21:55.564
<i>I thought I'd feel even more lonely
and sentimental.</i>

21:57.566 --> 21:59.609
Hey, Ms. Alina!

22:00.527 --> 22:02.946
Hurry up and get over here!

22:04.239 --> 22:06.074
<i>But with all these noisy people around me,</i>

22:06.158 --> 22:08.327
<i>I don't have time to think about that.</i>

22:10.245 --> 22:11.747
I see.

22:12.581 --> 22:14.791
Seems like I'm not lonely.

22:15.375 --> 22:16.376
Ms. Alina?

22:17.002 --> 22:19.671
- What's wrong?
- Nothing.

22:22.215 --> 22:23.175
Come on, Ms. Alina.

22:23.258 --> 22:24.092
- Give me your hand.
- What?

22:24.176 --> 22:25.260
- Let's hold hands.
- No way!

22:25.343 --> 22:27.929
- It's so we don't get separated.
- I don't want to! Wait.

23:59.312 --> 24:00.147
<i>Next episode.</i>

24:00.230 --> 24:01.731
<i>"I may be a receptionist for three years,</i>

24:01.815 --> 24:03.984
<i>but I'll join the newcomer training."</i>
